  "description": "It was discovered that Ghostscript incorrectly handled JPEG 2000 image\ncomponents with mismatched subsampling factors. An attacker could\npossibly use this issue to cause Ghostscript to crash or execute\narbitrary code if it opened a specially crafted file.",
